
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Game Nova - Play Games</title>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101522">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #101522;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    header {
      padding: 22px 15px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #19243a;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #39e6a0;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0; color: #39e6a0; font-size: 36px; }
    header p { color: #cbd5e1; }
    nav { margin-top: 18px; }
    nav a { color: white; margin: 0 10px; text-decoration: none; }
    main { padding: 25px 15px; text-align: center; }
    .hero { padding: 24px 10px; }
    .hero h2 { font-size: 30px; }
    .hero p { color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6; }
    .games {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 400px));
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 25px auto;
    }
    .card {
      padding: 22px;
      background: #202c43;
      border: 1px solid #3b4c68;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }
    .cover { font-size: 75px; }
    .card h3 { color: #39e6a0; }
    .card p { color: #d2d9e6; line-height: 1.6; }
    .play {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #39e6a0;
      color: #101522;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .play:active { transform: scale(.97); }
    footer {
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #aab5c8;
      background: #19243a;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🎮 Game Nova</h1>
    <p>Discover. Play. Survive.</p>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#games">Games</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="home">
    <section class="hero">
      <h2>Welcome to Game Nova!</h2>
      <p>Jump into exciting games, explore new worlds, and have fun.</p>
    </section>

    <h2 id="games">🔥 Featured Games</h2>
    <section class="games">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="cover">🌲🐺</div>
        <h3>WildCraft Survival</h3>
        <p>Explore a 3D forest, collect wood and stone, and survive against wolves!</p>
        <a class="play" href="wildcraft.html">▶ PLAY NOW</a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p>More games coming soon!</p>
  </main>

  <footer>© 2026 Game Nova · Made for gamers ❤️</footer>
</body>
</html>
